OL,3,CMan, 18, dies after getting into
OL,4,Cdifficulty in the sea at Camber Sands
OL,6,FA man has died after being pulled from
OL,7,Fthe water at Camber Sands in Rye in
OL,8,FEast Sussex.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,11,Fbeach at 7pm on Sunday (9 August)to
OL,12,Freports that three people had gotten
OL,13,Finto difficulty after entering the
OL,14,Fwater.
OL,16,FA large search operation was launched
OL,17,Fand a 16-year-old boy and an 18-year-
OL,18,Fold man, were found and safely left
OL,19,Fthe water.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/2
