OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786470511
OL,3,CMan, 18, dies after getting into
OL,4,Cdifficulty in the sea at Camber Sands
OL,6,FA third man, aged 18, was pulled from
OL,7,Fthe water at around 7.30pm.
OL,9,FA spokesperson for Sussex Police said:
OL,10,F"Sadly, despite lifesaving attempts by
OL,11,Fparamedics at the scene, he was
OL,12,Fpronounced deceased a short while
OL,13,Flater.
OL,15,F"His next of kin have been informed,
OL,16,Fand our thoughts are with them.
OL,18,F"Enquiries in the area remain ongoing,
OL,19,Fand an increased emergency presence is
OL,20,Fvisible at this time."
